1
00:00:00,808 --> 00:00:01,878
(Howard:)No.

2
00:00:02,043 --> 00:00:04,283
(Leonard:)Really? Because I just heard,
"Will you marry me?"

3
00:00:04,445 --> 00:00:07,445
(Leonard:)That's two proposals,
one day.

4
00:00:07,615 --> 00:00:09,725
(Leonard:)Sounds like someone wants
to spend the rest of her life

5
00:00:09,884 --> 00:00:12,664
(Leonard:)telling people how to spell
the name Hofstadter.

6
00:00:14,255 --> 00:00:16,895
(Penny:)You know what? Fine.
Do whatever you want.

7
00:00:17,591 --> 00:00:18,591
(Leonard:)Hey.

8
00:00:18,726 --> 00:00:21,226
(Leonard:)Penny, don't get upset.

9
00:00:21,328 --> 00:00:23,068
(Scene:)Here.

10
00:00:23,164 --> 00:00:27,014
(Leonard:)I love you, but, no,
I will not marry you.

11
00:00:27,168 --> 00:00:28,648
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

12
00:00:28,803 --> 00:00:32,613
(Leonard:)Now, about that second proposal.
On the one hand...

13
00:00:43,751 --> 00:00:46,961
(Arthur:)Where... where... where are we?

14
00:00:47,688 --> 00:00:50,138
(Sheldon:)This is the swampland
of Dagobah.

15
00:00:50,291 --> 00:00:54,301
(Sheldon:)It's where Luke was trained
in the ways of the Jedi.

16
00:00:54,361 --> 00:01:04,021
(Arthur:)Too bad.
I thought it was Florida.

